// The PBR shader (pbr_ps30 / pbr_vs30, pbr_dx9.cpp): brushes lit by a bumped
// lightmap and models by the ambient cube (or the env map with
// $useenvambient) and local lights, with metalness/roughness/occlusion from
// the MRAO texture, a normal map whose tangent frame comes from screen-space
// derivatives, the env map's specular, emission, a specular F0 texture,
// parallax occlusion and fog. Quads are in clip space (identity
// transforms), so the eye is at the origin. Cube maps are point sampled.
